WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.220
- You have an awesome
connection with your fans.

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:03.280
- Yes!

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:04.113
- And I actually love that about you

00:00:04.113 --> 00:00:05.370
and I think that's why you're successful

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:08.540
and, what is like maybe, your most fun,

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:10.220
or coolest kind of fan encounter?

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:11.053
- I mean there's so many,

00:00:11.053 --> 00:00:14.660
I really do genuinely
love my fans so much,

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:16.180
I mean, when you come from,
- It shows.

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:17.870
the digital space, you really understand

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:18.950
that there's no record label,

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:20.890
there's no one that started,

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:22.450
except for people just
supporting you online.

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:24.960
So those supporters are really responsible

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:26.160
for a lot of what I have

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:27.610
and I have so much love for them.

00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:29.960
But one of the most meaningful stories

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.860
I think, you know, earlier this year

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:34.420
when I came out online,

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:36.309
I remember I was really scared

00:00:36.309 --> 00:00:38.550
and it was before I had a trip to India.

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:40.580
And, you know, Indian
culture is quite taboo

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:41.570
when it comes to sexuality

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:43.247
and I was so stressed going
to India and I was like,

00:00:43.247 --> 00:00:44.257
"Oh, what are people gonna think?

00:00:44.257 --> 00:00:45.170
"I don't know."

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:46.620
And I had a meet and greet

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:49.170
and I met with two hundred
fans, and honestly,

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:51.890
I'd say about a hundred fans came up to me

00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:53.490
to my face, during that meet and greet

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:56.100
and for me that was so powerful because

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:57.730
one, I know how hard that is.

00:00:57.730 --> 00:01:00.007
And I was like, "Wow, me being myself

00:01:00.007 --> 00:01:00.840
"did something for you."
- And you inspired them

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:02.140
to be confident enough to say that.

00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:03.360
- And what better legacy, you know?

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:05.149
- That's the coolest.
- And so, that was very cool.

00:01:05.149 --> 00:01:06.030
(applause)

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:06.863
- Thank you.

